---
import ProseLayout from '../../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { getBrand, site } from '../../config/site';
const brand = getBrand('en');
const effective = '2026-10-29';
---

<ProseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${brand.name} handles your data, cookies and Google AdSense advertising.`}
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <p>Effective date: {effective}</p>
  <p>
    {brand.name} ({site.url}, “the site”, “we”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what information the site collects,
    how it is used, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>What you enter into the tools</h2>
  <p>
    Every tool on the site runs locally in your browser. The text, numbers and files you enter are not uploaded to our servers and
    are not stored by us. Some tools remember your last settings in your browser’s localStorage; you can remove them at any time by
    clearing your browser data.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The site uses Google AdSense to show ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior
    visits to this site or other websites.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or
      other sites on the internet.
    </li>
    <li>
      You can opt out of personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>,
      and opt out of third-party vendors’ cookies for personalized advertising at
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      For details, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">how Google uses cookies in advertising</a>
      and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If you are in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or Switzerland, the site asks for your consent to cookies through
    a Google-certified consent management platform before personalized ads are shown.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We may use Google Analytics to understand overall traffic, such as page views and device types. This information is aggregated
    and is used only to improve the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Server logs</h2>
  <p>
    Like most websites, our hosting automatically records access logs (IP address, browser type, time of request). These logs are
    used only for operations and abuse prevention, and are deleted periodically.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site is a general-audience tool site and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>The site may link to other websites. Their privacy practices are not covered by this policy.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a new effective date. If you have any
    questions, please reach us through the <a href="/en/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
